<title>HUNGARY: Hungarian interbank forex market closed.</title>
<headline>Hungarian interbank forex market closed.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hungarian interbank forex market is closed due to Christmas holidays.</p>
<p>The market will reopen with normal trading hours on Friday, Dec 27th.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
